 "schema": "fmc-recipe/0.1",
 "family": "FMC_I_MedEq_MRI_Scanner",
 "template": "Metric Generic Model.rft",
 "about": "MRI modelled as a generic product inside the vendor envelope: plinth, magnet cover with front and rear flares, bore liner, LED ring, front control panels with displays, cold head housing, table with floor plate, pedestal, carrier, cradle, pad, head coil and handle. 5 gauss line on Clearance Radiation (non-plotting). Chilled water via the service point. Water and gases via the nested service point (FMC_P_MechEq_ServicePoint); Medical Equipment cannot hold pipe connectors. Reference: query: mri scanner medical equipment hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=mri+scanner+medical+equipment+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
